{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":47,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["巴比倫的覆滅"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"「處女巴比倫啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"下來坐在塵土中吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女迦勒底啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坐在沒有寶座的地上吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你必不再稱得上嬌柔細嫩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要推磨磨麵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"揭下面紗，掀起裙子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"露出大腿，涉水過河。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必赤身裸體，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"露出羞處。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必報仇，不放過一人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的救贖主是以色列的聖者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂名叫萬軍之耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"「迦勒底少女啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要默默地坐著，進入黑暗中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你不再被稱為列國之後。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾向我的子民發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓我的產業被玷污，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他們交在你手中。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你對他們毫不留情，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至讓老人負極重的軛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你聲稱要永遠做王后，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不把這些事放在心上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不思想以後的結局。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「淫逸安舒的人啊，聽著！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你自以為天下無雙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必不致寡居，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不會遭喪子之痛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰知兩件事卻在同一天忽然臨到你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使你施展許多邪術和符咒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寡居和喪子也必全然臨到你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"「你肆無忌憚地行惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自以為沒有人看見。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你被自己的聰明智慧欺騙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自以為天下無雙。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必大禍臨頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不知如何祛災避禍。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"災禍必落在你身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無可挽回。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你意想不到的禍患必突然來到。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"「你自幼就勤練符咒和五花八門的邪術，繼續施展吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也許會有用處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也許會令人害怕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾多的計謀使你疲憊不堪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓那些觀天象、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每月說預言的占星家來救你脫離將臨的災禍吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"「看啊，他們不過像碎稭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必遭焚燒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無法救自己脫離烈焰。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這火並非取暖的炭火，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不是人可以靠近的火。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你自幼交往並一同勞碌的占星家幫不上你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們都各陷迷途，無人救你。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/47.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/48.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/46.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}